"""Host-driven cases against a leased persistent boot, using the boot host's OpenSSH.

Run after install-persistent and `metal-run boot --persistent`:
    server-suite --boot ID --sha COMMIT --milestone server/ssh-keys|server/services|users/operator-login
Site fields: SERVER_SSH_HOST, OPERATOR_USER, OPERATOR_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY, and CONSOLE_USER and
CONSOLE_PASSWORD, the console account, to act as root on the SOL console. The users suite's
operator category also uses OPERATOR_UID and OPERATOR_PASSWORD, the operator's own password,
for sudo and the operator's console login. The boot stays leased until the caller stops it
through metal-run.
"""
